; The meat king - everything the line threw away, rotted together in the pit into one great body: heaped red meat and
; yellow fat, ribs showing through it, a cow's skull pushed up where a head should be with eyes burning in it, a heart
; glowing through the meat like the furnace, and a cleaver in each fist.

